#: ../../production.md:1
msgid "Production checklist"
msgstr "Àkójọ ìṣàyẹ̀wò production"

#: ../../production.md:3
msgid ""
"Work through this list before you ship. Each item comes from something "
"that goes wrong in real integrations."
msgstr ""
"Ṣe àyẹ̀wò àkójọ yìí kí o tó tu ohun èlò náà jáde. Ohun kọ̀ọ̀kan nínú rẹ̀ "
"wá láti inú ohun tí ó lè lọ níṣòro nínú integrations gidi."

#: ../../production.md:5
msgid "Before you deploy"
msgstr "Ṣáájú deployment"

#: ../../production.md:7
msgid ""
"Store API keys in environment variables or a secrets manager, never in "
"source code."
msgstr ""
"Fi àwọn API keys pamọ́ sínú environment variables tàbí secrets manager, "
"kò yẹ kí wọ́n wà nínú source code."

#: ../../production.md:8
msgid ""
"Never expose a key in a browser or mobile app. Call the API from your own"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Má ṣe fi key hàn rí nínú browser tàbí mobile app. Pe API náà láti inú "
"server tirẹ."

#: ../../production.md:9
msgid ""
"Set a timeout on every request. Without one, a stalled connection can "
"hang your application."
msgstr ""
"Ṣètò timeout fún gbogbo request. Láìsí rẹ̀, connection tí ó dúró lè mú "
"application rẹ dúró."

#: ../../production.md:10
msgid ""
"Retry `429` and `500` responses and network failures. Do not retry other "
"`4xx` errors."
msgstr ""
"Gbìyànjú `429` àti `500` responses àti network failures lẹ́ẹ̀kansi. "
"Má ṣe gbìyànjú àwọn `4xx` errors mìíràn lẹ́ẹ̀kansi."

#: ../../production.md:11
msgid ""
"Wait for `Retry-After` on a `429`, and use exponential backoff with a "
"little random jitter for everything else."
msgstr ""
"Dúró de `Retry-After` lórí `429`, kí o sì lo exponential backoff pẹ̀lú "
"random jitter díẹ̀ fún gbogbo ohun mìíràn."

#: ../../production.md:12
msgid "Log the `request_id` of every failed request so support can find it."
msgstr ""
"Ṣe log `request_id` ti gbogbo request tí ó kuna kí support lè rí i."

#: ../../production.md:13
msgid "Do not log prompts or responses. They may contain personal data."
msgstr ""
"Má ṣe log prompts tàbí responses. Wọ́n lè ní data ti ara ẹni nínú."

#: ../../production.md:14
msgid "Check `finish_reason`. A value of `length` means the response was cut off."
msgstr ""
"Ṣàyẹ̀wò `finish_reason`. Iye `length` túmọ̀ sí pé a gé response náà kúrò."

#: ../../production.md:15
msgid "Record `usage.total_tokens` so you can see how much each feature uses."
msgstr ""
"Ṣàkọsílẹ̀ `usage.total_tokens` kí o lè rí iye tí feature kọ̀ọ̀kan ń lò."

#: ../../production.md:16
msgid ""
"Choose the `region` on purpose and confirm the `X-Data-Region` header "
"matches what you expect."
msgstr ""
"Yan `region` pẹ̀lú ète, kí o sì jẹ́rìí pé header `X-Data-Region` bá ohun "
"tí o retí mu."

#: ../../production.md:17
msgid ""
"Handle `model_not_found`. Do not assume a model ID will exist forever. "
"List models at startup if you can."
msgstr ""
"Ṣàkóso `model_not_found`. Má ṣe rò pé model ID kan yóò wà títí láé. "
"Ṣàkójọ àwọn models nígbà tí eto bá bẹ̀rẹ̀ bí o bá lè ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀."

#: ../../production.md:18
msgid "Monitor how long requests take, and alert when they get slower."
msgstr ""
"Ṣàbójútó iye àkókò tí requests ń gba, kí o sì fi ìkìlọ̀ ránṣẹ́ nígbà tí "
"wọ́n bá ń lọ́ra síi."

#: ../../production.md:20
msgid "A client that follows the list"
msgstr "Client kan tí ó tẹ̀lé àkójọ náà"

#: ../../production.md:22
msgid ""
"The repository includes a small Python client that covers the timeout, "
"retry, backoff and logging items. This is its request method."
msgstr ""
"Repository náà ní Python client kékeré kan tí ó bo àwọn ohun tí ó kan "
"timeout, retry, backoff àti logging. Èyí ni request method rẹ̀."

#: ../../production.md:29
msgid "A few choices worth pointing out:"
msgstr "Àwọn ìpinnu díẹ̀ tí ó yẹ ká mẹ́nu kàn:"

#: ../../production.md:31
msgid ""
"It gives up straight away if the server asks for a wait longer than "
"`max_retry_wait`. A request that blocks for a minute is usually worse "
"than a clear failure."
msgstr ""
"Ó máa ń dáwọ́ dúró lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ bí server bá béèrè fún ìdúró tó ju "
"`max_retry_wait` lọ. Request tí ó dí fún ìṣẹ́jú kan sábà máa ń burú ju "
"failure tí ó ṣe kedere lọ."

#: ../../production.md:32
msgid ""
"It logs the status, error type and request ID. It never logs the prompt "
"or the response."
msgstr ""
"Ó ń log status, error type àti request ID. Kò ṣe log prompt tàbí response "
"rí."

#: ../../production.md:33
msgid ""
"It only retries statuses in `RETRYABLE_STATUS`. A `400` will not succeed "
"on a second attempt, so the client raises it at once."
msgstr ""
"Ó ń gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kansi fún àwọn statuses tó wà nínú "
"`RETRYABLE_STATUS` nìkan. `400` kò ní ṣàṣeyọrí ní ìgbìyànjú kejì, "
"nítorí náà client náà máa ń gbé e sókè lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀."